<title>UK: BT says Vallance elected to Mobil board.</title>
<headline>BT says Vallance elected to Mobil board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Tuesday that its chairman Iain Vallance has been elected a member of the the board of directors of U.S. oil company Mobil Corp with effect from November 1.  </p>
<p>BT said it welcomed the international recognition of its chairman's reputation symbolised by the appointment.</p>
<p>Vallance was appointed as Chairman of BT in 1987 and is also a non-executive vice chairman of the Royal Bank of Scotland Plc RBOS.L.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
